## Installation

This package is [ESM only](https://blog.sindresorhus.com/get-ready-for-esm-aa53530b3f77).

{{#ifSatisfy "equals" model.implementation.tags "cli"}}
```bash
yarn global add {{model.github.name}}
{{model.github.name}} --help
```
Or alternatively run it:
```bash
npx {{model.github.name}} --help
```
If you want to tun the latest version from github. Mostly useful for dev:
```bash
git clone git@github.com:{{model.github.account}}/{{model.github.name}}.git
yarn global add `pwd`
```
{{/ifSatisfy}}
{{#ifSatisfy "not equals" model.implementation.tags "cli"}}
```bash
yarn add {{model.github.name}}
```
{{/ifSatisfy}}
